        "version": "v1.4.419",
        "author": "github-actions[bot]",
        "date": "2026-02-22",
        "summary": "## Changes\n\n### PR [#2020](https://github.com/danielmiessler/Fabric/pull/2020) by [ksylvan](https://github.com/ksylvan): Add `wire` Debug Level for LLM Request/Response Logging\n\n- Feat: add `wire` debug level (4) for full LLM request/response debug logging\n- Add `Wire` log level constant to debug level enum and expose `GetLevel()` for safe concurrent level reads\n- Log outbound message roles/content, inbound stream updates, token usage, and non-streaming LLM responses at wire debug level\n- Update `--debug` flag description and `set_debug_level` locale strings across all 10 languages to include new level 4\n- Update zsh, bash, and fish shell completions to include the new `4` (`wire`) debug level value\n",
        "assets_count": 9,
        "url": "https://github.com/danielmiessler/Fabric/releases/tag/v1.4.419",
        "ai_summary": {
          "change_type": "feature",
          "key_changes": [
            "新增 `wire` 调试级别（级别 4），用于完整的 LLM 请求/响应日志记录",
            "暴露 `GetLevel()` 方法以支持安全的并发级别读取",
            "记录出站消息角色/内容、入站流更新、令牌使用量和非流式 LLM 响应",
            "更新所有 10 种语言的 `--debug` 标志描述和本地化字符串",
            "更新 zsh、bash 和 fish shell 自动补全以支持新的调试级别 4"
          ],
          "summary_cn": "此版本新增了 `wire` 调试级别（级别 4），提供完整的 LLM 请求/响应日志记录功能，包括出站消息、入站流更新、令牌使用量等详细信息。同时更新了所有语言的文档和 shell 自动补全支持，增强了调试能力。该变更不影响现有功能，属于纯新增特性。",
          "impact_level": 2
        }
      },
      {
        "repo": "danielmiessler/fabric",
        "version": "v1.4.418",
        "author": "github-actions[bot]",
        "date": "2026-02-22",
        "summary": "## Changes\n\n### PR [#2019](https://github.com/danielmiessler/Fabric/pull/2019) by [ksylvan](https://github.com/ksylvan): feat: replace hardcoded error strings with i18n translation keys\n\n- Replace hardcoded error messages with `i18n.T()` calls across Go source files, covering chat, attachment, storage, template, plugin registry, server, and utility packages\n- Added approximately 80 new translation keys to all locale files (en, de, es, fa, fr, it, ja, pt-BR, pt-PT, zh), with keys sorted alphabetically\n- Internationalized error strings across githelper, notifications, patterns, sessions, and provider modules (DigitalOcean, Gemini, OpenAI-compatible)\n- Refactored `fmt.Errorf(\"%s\", ...)` usages to `errors.New()` and normalized i18n error strings to lowercase per Go conventions\n- Updated `db_error_loading_env_file` format verb from `%s` to `%w` to support proper error wrapping\n",
        "assets_count": 9,
